  "description": "Bubbonic is a modern playful bubble font that brings a burst of joy to any design. Its ultra-thick, rounded forms are reminiscent of vinyl stickers and retro street art, making it an instant eye-catcher. This typeface is a fantastic choice for youth-oriented branding, sticker designs, gaming interfaces, and bold packaging where you want the text to literally “pop” off the page.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bubbonic is a modern playful bubble font that brings a burst of joy to any design. Its ultra-thick, rounded forms are reminiscent of vinyl stickers and retro street art, making it an instant eye-catcher. This typeface is a fantastic choice for youth-oriented branding, sticker designs, gaming interfaces, and bold packaging where you want the text to literally “pop” off the page.</p>",
